{"id":"wb-7-987","name":"汪氏小苑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汪氏小苑","text":"汪氏小苑是今存扬州较为完整的清末民初盐商住宅之一。主人汪竹铭原先是徽商。位于江苏省扬州市广陵区东关街。\n2002年10月22日，公布为江苏省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%AA%E6%B0%8F%E5%B0%8F%E8%8B%91","revisionId":91692720,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91692720","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1d06dcbc0b02ed32a0b6cb2d.jpg","title":"春晖室0933.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%98%A5%E6%99%96%E5%AE%A40933.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/%E6%98%A5%E6%99%96%E5%AE%A40933.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​春晖室正厅","width":320,"height":213}}